        "TileImage": "$($repository 20425aca-a329-4ece-90a4-3d352ec1c004).Image",
        "Description": "Mission 2.\rAfter the events at Bangkok, it has been discovered the the members of the mafia were in Lucas Grey&apos;s private militia. As you know, Lucas Grey is dead. His militia has gone rouge and become a group of organized criminals. Olivia Hall has asked us to put a stop to it. Some of the members have been tracked down to the Dartmoor Garden Show. Eliot and Sevastion are high level members of the militia. We are hoping that more information is revealed with their deaths.",
